'''Grom'gol Base Camp''' (or '''Grom'Gol''')<ref>[[Hin Denburg#Quotes]]</ref> is an [[orc]]ish camp on the northwestern coast of [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. Led by [[Commander Aggro'gosh]], the outpost provides a safe chain of supply to [[Stonard]] in the [[Swamp of Sorrows]]. This fort is heavily strengthened to be able to guard against [[jungle troll]]s, [[naga]], and the many members of the [[Alliance]] who arrive from [[Booty Bay]] and [[Duskwood]].

